    <!--
        "How to watch my channels" screen (S4). It explains in plain words that HaP is a server and
        never a player, and shows the real playlist address. The Spanish file carries the exact
        wording of the approved mockup; this file is its English translation.
    -->
    <string name="connect_intro">HaP is an IPTV server: it does not play video itself. Your channels are played by your own player, connected to HaP.</string>
